Quest 697 "[Lemegeton] Preparation for sealing"
    Journal for karus "You must help [Order of the Sorcery] Bros to prepare for sealing devil."
    Journal for elmorad "You must help [Order of the Sorcery] Sais to prepare for sealing devil."
    Collect 1 of 900216000
    Collect 1 of 900217000

Requires player level >= 70 and quest 696 is completed

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 30000 coins
    Give 1 of 900216000
    Give 1 of 900217000

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Hmm,it's the [Devil War]. We may just have gotten ourselves into trouble again. Shall we go to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery]?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Hmm,it's the [Devil War]. We may just have gotten ourselves into trouble again. Shall we go to Sais of [Order of the Sorcery]?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "To seal the devils, [Seal Ring] which can hold their souls is required."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "I'm not able to leave my place now, so please collect the materials instead of me. First, receive [Ordinary old ring] from [Daughter of Grand Merchant] Menissiah of Moradon and [Magical power transmit marble] from [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond, in Folk Village of Moradon, and bring them to me."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "Mm-hmm...You don't have them yet? You can get [Ordinary old ring] from [Daughter of Grand Merchant] Menissiah of Moradon and the [Magic Power Tranmission/Diffusion Marble] from [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond of Moradon folk Village. Please hurry."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Mm-hmm...You don't have them yet? You can get [Ordinary old ring] from Menisia, the Grand Merchant's Daughter] of Moradon and the [Magic Power Tranmission/Diffusion Marble] from [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond of Moradon Folk Village. Please hurry."

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "So you collected them all. Great work.\n\nNow, [Elaborated Sealed ring] must be made by using [Ordinary old ring] and [Magical power transmit marble]. There is a great jeweller in Moradon by the name of Jewel, the [Jeweller] Juel. You can get help from him."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "So you collected them all. Great work.\n\nNow, [Elaborated Sealed ring] must be made by using [Ordinary old ring] and [Magical power transmit marble]. There is a great jeweller in Moradon by the name of Jewel, the [Jeweller]. You can get help from him."
